{
  "id": "jungle",
  "title": "Interior jungle",
  "comment": "The dense interior: close, percussive, irregular. E phrygian, 105 bpm in 7/4 (bar 4 s, like every region track), 8 bars. Everything is in sevens and fourteens, so the ear never finds the downbeat for long: knocks on 5-in-14, insects on a 14-step grid with most hits missing, a marimba-like ostinato that changes every other bar.",
